<%# The follow-up composer as the drawer shows it while a session's detail body is
    in flight: part of _drawer_skeleton, so it is on screen the moment the drawer
    slides in rather than after the body's fetch. Typing needs nothing from the
    server, so it does not wait for it.

    Shaped like _follow_up_form's desktop row (the drawer is desktop-only — a
    phone opens the full page, where the real composer is in the first response),
    and pinned to the bottom the same way, so the swap to the real one does not
    move the field.

    It knows nothing about the session but its id, which session-drawer#open
    writes onto it from the card that was clicked. Everything else — queue or
    send, the running indicator, attachments, slash commands — is the real
    composer's, and fills in when it arrives. Until then Submit is disabled: the
    endpoint a message goes to is the server-rendered form's decision.

    What is typed here is the session's draft (drawer_composer_controller.js),
    and the caret and focus are handed to the real composer as it replaces this
    one (lib/composer_handoff.js). No id on the textarea: the real one is
    data-turbo-permanent, keyed by id, and must not be matched against this. %>
<div data-drawer-composer
     data-controller="drawer-composer"
     class="fixed bottom-0 left-0 right-0 z-20 bg-white border-t border-gray-200 shadow-lg">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-3 sm:py-4">
    <%# mb-3: the real form's row sits in a space-y-3 stack with the phone row
        under it, which leaves that much below it even while the phone row is
        hidden; matching it keeps the field from moving at the swap. %>
    <div class="mb-3 flex items-end space-x-4">
      <div class="flex-1">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
          <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700" data-drawer-composer-label>
            Follow-up Prompt
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">(loading session…)</span>
          </label>
        </div>
        <textarea name="drawer_composer_prompt"
                  rows="3"
                  aria-label="Follow-up prompt"
                  placeholder="Start typing — the session is still loading"
                  class="block w-full rounded-md border-gray-300 shadow-sm focus:border-indigo-500 focus:ring-indigo-500 sm:text-sm px-3 py-2"
                  data-drawer-composer-target="textarea"
                  data-action="input->drawer-composer#save"></textarea>
      </div>
      <%# The real row's attachment buttons, inert, so the field is the same width
          before and after the swap and does not move under the caret. %>
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
        <button type="button" disabled aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
                class="inline-flex items-center p-2 border border-gray-300 text-sm font-medium rounded-md text-gray-400 bg-white opacity-60 cursor-not-allowed">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <button type="button" disabled aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
                class="inline-flex items-center p-2 border border-gray-300 text-sm font-medium rounded-md text-gray-400 bg-white opacity-60 cursor-not-allowed">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 9a2 2 0 012-2h.93a2 2 0 001.664-.89l.812-1.22A2 2 0 0110.07 4h3.86a2 2 0 011.664.89l.812 1.22A2 2 0 0018.07 7H19a2 2 0 012 2v9a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V9z"/>
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 13a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <button type="button" disabled aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
                class="inline-flex items-center p-2 border border-gray-300 text-sm font-medium rounded-md text-gray-400 bg-white opacity-60 cursor-not-allowed">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15.172 7l-6.586 6.586a2 2 0 102.828 2.828l6.414-6.586a4 4 0 00-5.656-5.656l-6.415 6.585a6 6 0 108.486 8.486L20.5 13"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <button type="button" disabled aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
                class="inline-flex items-center p-2 border border-gray-300 text-sm font-medium rounded-md text-gray-400 bg-white opacity-60 cursor-not-allowed">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 7a2 2 0 012-2h4l2 2h8a2 2 0 012 2v8a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V7z"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <button type="button" disabled
                title="Available once the session has loaded"
                class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 border border-transparent text-sm font-medium rounded-md shadow-sm text-white bg-indigo-600 opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed">
          Send Message
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
